OL,3,AUK lost more than it gained from
OL,4,ABrexit, Burnham to say ahead of EU
OL,5,Asummit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister is seeking to sign
OL,8,Fnew agreements on food, energy and
OL,9,Fyouth mobility with the bloc at
OL,10,FFriday's summit, where he has said a
OL,11,F"win-win" deal can be struck.
OL,13,FThe Conservatives have previously said
OL,14,FLabour are "dragging us into the
OL,15,FEuropean Union via the back door with
OL,16,Ftheir EU reset".
